OL,3,GStrathclyde
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FShowers and
OL,6,Fclear spells this evening and
OL,7,Fovernight. Showers occasional across
OL,8,FArgyll, but relatively isolated from
OL,9,FGlasgow southwards. South to southwest
OL,10,Fwinds freshening across the coasts and
OL,11,FIsles.
OL,12,
OL,13,CSaturday:FFrom the Central Belt
OL,14,Fsouthwards mainly dry by day with
OL,15,Foccasional sunny spells. Argyll seeing
OL,16,Foccasional showers, that build during
OL,17,Fevening, bringing the risk of
OL,18,Fthunderstorms, as southwest winds
OL,19,Fstrengthen.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
