OL,3,GStrathclyde
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Sunday to Tuesday:
OL,6,FUnsettled for Sunday with showers or
OL,7,Flonger periods of rain, with
OL,8,FLanarkshire seeing best shelter. Most
OL,9,Fdry on Monday with showers generally
OL,10,Fconfined to Argyll. Tuesday turning
OL,11,Fwet and windy.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
